# Derived files regenerated by `./scripts/regen.sh` from sources
# that ARE in git (`vendor/aws-sdk-rust/aws-models/*.json` and
# `vendor/smithy/...`). Kept out of git so the diff stays focused
# on hand-written code (~135 kLOC saved between services, endpoint
# fixtures, and protocol-test ASTs).

# Generated service clients (real + protocol-test surrogate).
/src/aws/services/

# Endpoint rule-set + tests, extracted per-service from the
# `smithy.rules#endpointRuleSet` / `endpointTests` traits inside
# `vendor/aws-sdk-rust/aws-models/*.json` by
# `./scripts/extract-endpoints.sh`.
/test/fixtures/endpoints/

# Smithy AST output for the protocol-test models, produced by
# `./scripts/build-protocol-test-asts.sh` (requires the Smithy CLI
# under `.tools/`).
/test/fixtures/protocol-tests/

# Protocol-test dispatcher modules STAY in git for now: the
# Python generator regex-scrapes the just-emitted Gleam service
# modules, and not every restXml op has a green codec, so the
# committed dispatchers are a curated subset. Pass 2 of plan.md
# moves dispatcher generation into the Gleam emitter and unblocks
# evicting these from the index too.
